<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 15:41:19 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Fmr1 KO 小鼠行为抑制受损与视觉皮层 θ 振荡破坏有关</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/impaired-behavioral-inhibition-in-fmr1-ko-mice-is-linked-to-disrupted-visual-cortex-theta-oscillations</link><description>齐默尔曼等人。显示行为抑制的丧失与 Fmr1 KO 小鼠初级视觉皮层、海马区的 theta 活动减弱以及前额叶皮层自上而下控制的缺陷相关。这些发现揭示了脆性 X 综合征行为缺陷背后的回路水平损伤，以进行潜在的治疗干预。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/impaired-behavioral-inhibition-in-fmr1-ko-mice-is-linked-to-disrupted-visual-cortex-theta-oscillations2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 15:41:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/impaired-behavioral-inhibition-in-fmr1-ko-mice-is-linked-to-disrupted-visual-cortex-theta-oscillations</guid></item><item><title>新测量表明，恒星形成减少并不是简单的“燃料危机”造成的</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/declining-star-formation-not-caused-by-simple-fuel-crisis-new-measurements-suggest</link><description>宇宙中的恒星“婴儿”越来越少。在过去的 45 亿年里，恒星诞生的速度已降至以前的一半以下。但这里有一个转折点：制造恒星最重要的“燃料”几乎没有减少。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/declining-star-formation-not-caused-by-simple-fuel-crisis-new-measurements-suggest.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 15:26:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/declining-star-formation-not-caused-by-simple-fuel-crisis-new-measurements-suggest</guid></item><item><title>自我进化系统警告</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/self-evolving-system-warning</link><description>不受控制地演化的系统可能会陷入混乱。佩戴救生艇自进化系统警告标志。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/self-evolving-system-warning2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 15:11:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/self-evolving-system-warning</guid></item><item><title>研究人类抗原特异性 T 细胞的挑战和前景</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-challenge-and-promise-of-studying-human-antigenspecific-t-cells-reviews-immunology</link><description>抗原特异性 T 细胞是免疫、癌症监测和自身免疫的基础，但仍然难以研究。这篇综述描述了有助于将 T 细胞受体特异性与功能联系起来的技术和计算方法，揭示了 T 细胞的内在特性如何影响感染、疫苗接种和疾病中的免疫结果。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-challenge-and-promise-of-studying-human-antigenspecific-t-cells-reviews-immunology.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 14:56:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-challenge-and-promise-of-studying-human-antigenspecific-t-cells-reviews-immunology</guid></item><item><title>20 年前，女性接受了预防性癌症治疗。现在它也保护男性</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/20-years-ago-women-got-a-preventative-cancer-treatment-now-its-protecting-men-too</link><description>很有可能采取预防措施&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/20-years-ago-women-got-a-preventative-cancer-treatment-now-its-protecting-men-too.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 14:41:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/20-years-ago-women-got-a-preventative-cancer-treatment-now-its-protecting-men-too</guid></item><item><title>SMA 新时代——从基因治疗到无极限生活 |特雷西·道森博士</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-new-era-of-sma-from-gene-therapy-to-living-without-limits-dr-tracey-dawson</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 14:26:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-new-era-of-sma-from-gene-therapy-to-living-without-limits-dr-tracey-dawson</guid></item><item><title>CMV — 潜伏在我们体内、可威胁移植患者的病毒 |尼尔·伊哈伯博士（医学博士）</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/cmv-the-virus-lurking-inside-us-that-can-threaten-transplant-patients-dr-neil-inhaber-md</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 14:11:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/cmv-the-virus-lurking-inside-us-that-can-threaten-transplant-patients-dr-neil-inhaber-md</guid></item><item><title>科学家发现人类特有的基因可能有助于解释我们的脑力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-find-a-human-only-gene-that-may-help-explain-our-brainpower</link><description>科学家发现，人类小胶质细胞（帮助塑造发育中的大脑回路的免疫细胞）可能需要四到八年才能成熟，而不是像小鼠那样只需几周时间。这一异常缓慢的过程可能有助于解释人类大脑如何发展其非凡的复杂性和认知能力。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-find-a-human-only-gene-that-may-help-explain-our-brainpower.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 13:56:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-find-a-human-only-gene-that-may-help-explain-our-brainpower</guid></item><item><title>科学家利用机器人在太平洋下方两公里多的地方发现了一座活水下火山周围巨大的熔岩场</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-use-robots-more-than-two-kilometres-beneath-the-pacific-to-discover-huge-lava-fields-around-an-active-underwater-volcano</link><description>在俄勒冈州海岸附近的太平洋表面以下两公里处，一座活跃的水下火山隐藏着有史以来在海底绘制的最奇怪的景观之一。蒙特利湾水族馆研究所的科学家们使用能够承受深度的机器人车辆，花了二十多年的时间来调查轴向海山，这是一座沿着胡安德富卡山脊的火山，自 20 世纪 80 年代发现以来，它已经多次喷发。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-use-robots-more-than-two-kilometres-beneath-the-pacific-to-discover-huge-lava-fields-around-an-active-underwater-volcano.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 13:41:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-use-robots-more-than-two-kilometres-beneath-the-pacific-to-discover-huge-lava-fields-around-an-active-underwater-volcano</guid></item><item><title>毕竟地球磁层可能无法保护我们免受超级风暴的侵害</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/earths-magnetosphere-might-not-protect-us-from-superstorms-after-all</link><description>科学似乎是一项简单的努力。您提出一个假设，收集数据来证明或反驳它，并分析该数据以确定该假设是否正确。但任何真正从事科学研究的人都会告诉你，事情往往没那么简单。最常见的复杂性之一是数据分析。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/earths-magnetosphere-might-not-protect-us-from-superstorms-after-all.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 13:26:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/earths-magnetosphere-might-not-protect-us-from-superstorms-after-all</guid></item></channel></rss>